WEBVTT

01:41.740 --> 01:48.960
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.600 --> 01:51.890
[Episode 26]

03:12.150 --> 03:17.240
[Yubai]

03:17.490 --> 03:21.630
[You're on your way back home, right?]

03:33.160 --> 03:36.630
[I'm a bit upset.]

03:36.720 --> 03:43.079
[Jiang Yubai]

03:37.030 --> 03:37.900
I'm a bit upset.

04:49.680 --> 04:51.330
Lin Lin Lin Lin Lin Zhixia.

04:52.240 --> 04:52.750
Hello,

04:54.010 --> 04:56.500
this is my Genius Observation Diary.

04:57.490 --> 05:00.060
Observer—Jiang Yubai.

05:04.010 --> 05:05.930
On September 1st, 2013, the new semester

05:04.260 --> 05:07.030
[Qingbei University]
[Welcome, new Qingbeiers.]

05:06.570 --> 05:08.370
started at Qingbei University.

05:09.010 --> 05:10.140
You said before that

05:11.040 --> 05:12.970
you wanted everyone to be together

05:13.390 --> 05:14.450
and never be apart.

05:16.120 --> 05:17.920
So I decided to come to Huacheng.

05:18.770 --> 05:20.430
Even though we couldn't meet,

05:21.510 --> 05:23.710
it was still nice to be under the same sky

05:25.660 --> 05:26.420
as you.

05:28.860 --> 05:31.130
On September 24th, 2014,

05:32.330 --> 05:33.330
you turned 20.

05:33.330 --> 05:35.130
-Happy birthday to you.
-Happy birthday to you.

05:35.130 --> 05:37.790
-Happy birthday to you.
-Happy birthday to you.

05:37.810 --> 05:40.470
-Happy birthday to you.
-Happy birthday to you.

05:41.280 --> 05:42.550
Happy birthday to you.

05:43.530 --> 05:44.400
Happy birthday!

05:44.400 --> 05:45.600
I saw you celebrating

05:46.190 --> 05:48.920
your birthday with them
at the restaurant today.

05:49.950 --> 05:51.250
I heard you wishing

05:51.250 --> 05:52.909
everyone could reunite soon,

05:53.280 --> 05:54.740
and I could come back soon.

05:56.100 --> 05:57.810
You are the only one missing.

05:59.190 --> 06:00.300
We are waiting for you.

06:00.300 --> 06:01.610
But you didn't know

06:02.510 --> 06:03.710
that I had never left.

06:05.870 --> 06:09.000
I was just not sure when

06:10.810 --> 06:12.340
I could return to your side.

06:15.540 --> 06:18.330
On September 7th, 2018,

06:20.420 --> 06:22.420
actually, that day in speech class,

06:22.690 --> 06:24.150
you weren't imagining it—

06:24.630 --> 06:26.090
I was right there with you.

06:29.230 --> 06:30.560
But I was hiding from you

06:31.160 --> 06:32.950
because you were running
further and further away

06:32.950 --> 06:34.280
toward a bright future.

06:34.890 --> 06:35.880
I was afraid that

06:36.930 --> 06:39.159
I would never be able
to catch up with you.

06:39.159 --> 06:42.130
On September 13th, 2018...

06:42.860 --> 06:44.190
You were looking for me?

06:45.130 --> 06:48.180
Did I have to appear
just because you were looking for me?

06:48.180 --> 06:50.130
Then what does this watch
have to do with you?

06:50.130 --> 06:51.250
Why did you fix it?

06:51.450 --> 06:52.370
You had been hiding for 5 years!

06:52.370 --> 06:53.659
Why did you show up now?

06:54.330 --> 06:56.380
Why didn't you just keep hiding?

06:56.540 --> 06:57.130
Yes!

06:58.450 --> 06:59.810
Yeah, I shouldn't have fixed it.

06:59.810 --> 07:00.540
I'm an idiot.

07:00.810 --> 07:01.810
My biggest regret now is

07:01.810 --> 07:03.240
ever fixing this stupid watch.

07:03.240 --> 07:05.170
I should never have let you find me!

07:07.240 --> 07:07.930
Lin Zhixia,

07:08.950 --> 07:10.610
I didn't mean to push you away.

07:11.620 --> 07:13.950
And neither did I
want to break your heart.

07:14.330 --> 07:17.700
I know my actions disappointed you.

07:19.860 --> 07:22.190
Actually, I really regretted it that day.

07:22.420 --> 07:25.220
I felt so powerless.

07:26.220 --> 07:27.750
But I didn't know what to do.

07:28.400 --> 07:29.400
I love you so much.

07:30.620 --> 07:31.270
But...

07:32.520 --> 07:33.370
I'm sorry.

07:35.010 --> 07:37.370
On November 20th, 2018,

07:39.950 --> 07:42.210
your brother asked me to take care of you.

07:42.240 --> 07:43.300
I was really happy.

07:44.370 --> 07:47.180
I didn't know when a genius

07:47.180 --> 07:49.580
could understand ordinary people's love,

07:50.420 --> 07:51.540
but I still decided

07:52.130 --> 07:54.630
to bury these feelings in your place.

07:55.870 --> 07:58.070
Because I firmly believed that one day,

07:58.390 --> 07:59.740
you would hear my voice.

08:08.420 --> 08:09.080
Lin Zhixia,

08:10.000 --> 08:11.600
thank you for hearing me out.

08:12.070 --> 08:13.070
And also thank you

08:13.420 --> 08:17.350
for having given me the motivation
to move forward for the past 5 years.

08:17.480 --> 08:17.980
Now,

08:18.680 --> 08:22.600
please press X and Y
on the model simultaneously.

08:37.909 --> 08:42.120
[Jiang Yubai loves Lin Zhixia
forever and ever.]

09:00.790 --> 09:02.440
Jiang Yubai, where are you?

09:02.570 --> 09:04.070
I want to see you right now.

09:54.740 --> 09:56.800
Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Jiang Yubai!

10:35.900 --> 10:37.480
♪ Warm fishbowl ♪

10:38.260 --> 10:39.930
♪ 2013 ♪

10:40.360 --> 10:42.000
♪ 16 times faster ♪

10:43.060 --> 10:45.010
♪ The night is like a window ♪

10:45.370 --> 10:47.590
♪ The night is like the sea ♪

10:48.050 --> 10:52.660
♪ Also like all the memories ♪

10:53.190 --> 10:54.810
♪ Frozen in frame ♪

10:55.100 --> 10:57.510
♪ The bluest dreamcore ♪

10:57.760 --> 10:59.600
♪ Your heart is ♪

10:59.910 --> 11:02.220
♪ A rotten one ♪

11:02.720 --> 11:04.530
♪ Silently fading ♪

11:04.970 --> 11:07.200
♪ Vanishing without a trace ♪

11:07.740 --> 11:09.600
♪ I walked in ♪

11:09.960 --> 11:11.740
♪ But couldn't find ♪

11:12.260 --> 11:14.580
♪ The exit ♪

11:14.930 --> 11:16.630
♪ You dwell within ♪

11:17.460 --> 11:19.280
♪ My daylight flight ♪

11:19.740 --> 11:22.170
♪ The bluest dreamcore ♪

11:22.450 --> 11:24.280
♪ Boundless, endless ♪

11:24.620 --> 11:26.720
♪ Can barely breathe ♪

11:27.380 --> 11:29.110
♪ Sinking to the seabed ♪

11:29.460 --> 11:31.620
♪ I don't know ♪

11:32.510 --> 11:35.430
♪ Why ♪

11:41.050 --> 11:41.780
Jiang Yubai.

11:45.100 --> 11:45.980
I like you.

11:48.820 --> 11:51.290
-What kind of like do you mean?
-I mean the kind

11:51.290 --> 11:52.870
of like you're thinking.

11:54.250 --> 11:55.580
It's the philosophical

11:55.940 --> 11:57.580
and biological kind of like.

11:58.860 --> 12:00.320
The ordinary kind of like.

12:04.170 --> 12:05.630
Actually, I've forgotten

12:07.010 --> 12:07.860
since when

12:07.860 --> 12:09.990
I started falling for you, Lin Zhixia.

12:10.750 --> 12:13.010
But I've often set deadlines for myself.

12:14.580 --> 12:15.530
I wanted to wait

12:16.860 --> 12:18.120
until I became an older

12:19.290 --> 12:20.350
and better person.

12:23.290 --> 12:24.690
But the more time passed,

12:25.700 --> 12:26.820
the more I doubted

12:27.940 --> 12:30.470
whether I, Jiang Yubai,
would be lucky enough

12:30.950 --> 12:32.480
to always be able to protect

12:33.290 --> 12:34.620
and like Lin Zhixia.

12:36.500 --> 12:38.770
Because I always felt that love was

12:40.130 --> 12:41.820
not very important to her.

12:44.580 --> 12:46.380
So being able to stay by your side

12:47.220 --> 12:48.750
already made me very happy.

12:51.010 --> 12:52.100
I'm prepared.

12:54.870 --> 12:57.330
Even if Lin Zhixia
doesn't know my feelings,

12:58.220 --> 12:58.670
I still...

12:58.670 --> 12:59.890
Lin Zhixia knows.

13:07.640 --> 13:11.980
♪ The moment our eyes met,
my world came alive with color ♪

13:12.620 --> 13:16.990
♪ Could this be how love begins? ♪

13:17.390 --> 13:20.520
♪ These unspoken feelings
are so hard to figure out ♪

13:21.060 --> 13:26.460
♪ Hidden deep within your gaze ♪

13:26.630 --> 13:31.170
♪ Sometimes, I imagine
drifting beyond the skies with you ♪

13:31.520 --> 13:36.050
♪ Shimmering light
dances over the flower in bloom ♪

13:36.470 --> 13:39.540
♪ After all we've been through,
our fates remain intertwined ♪

13:40.190 --> 13:46.540
♪ Perhaps fate favors me now ♪

13:41.500 --> 13:42.930
[Hematology Department]

13:58.090 --> 13:58.420
[Class Break]

14:00.220 --> 14:01.150
[Class Break]

14:01.010 --> 14:01.980
Are you telling everyone you're dating?

14:01.150 --> 14:02.060
[As expected. Congratulations.]

14:01.980 --> 14:02.820
So suddenly!

14:02.080 --> 14:03.440
[This is way too sudden.
Still, congratulations.]

14:04.130 --> 14:04.620
Mm.

14:05.770 --> 14:06.580
As expected.

14:06.770 --> 14:07.830
Congratulations!

14:08.550 --> 14:10.170
This is way too sudden.

14:10.700 --> 14:12.160
Still, congratulations.

14:28.750 --> 14:31.100
Congratulations. You two deserve this.

14:49.080 --> 14:49.750
Lin,

14:50.120 --> 14:51.620
Professor Wu has been
strongly recommending you,

14:51.620 --> 14:54.290
saying that you are the top talent
in the industry.

14:54.290 --> 14:56.740
We are currently focusing our efforts
on artificial intelligence.

14:56.740 --> 14:57.440
Right now,

14:57.530 --> 14:59.840
we are doing R&D
on machine learning algorithms.

14:59.840 --> 15:01.440
We really need you to join us.

15:02.650 --> 15:04.820
Ling, thank you for choosing me.

15:05.460 --> 15:07.790
But I have no plans
to leave school for now.

15:08.740 --> 15:10.820
It's not too late to start planning now.

15:10.820 --> 15:11.790
Scientific research talents

15:11.790 --> 15:13.920
need support and protection the most.

15:14.050 --> 15:15.030
The school environment is

15:15.030 --> 15:16.840
definitely not as good as our company's.

15:16.840 --> 15:18.480
The funding we've invested now

15:18.480 --> 15:19.810
is several times yours.

15:23.820 --> 15:26.100
Ling, you might not know this.

15:26.740 --> 15:28.500
My current project's research direction

15:28.500 --> 15:30.100
only requires computing power.

15:30.100 --> 15:32.360
The school's support is already enough.

15:32.650 --> 15:34.370
Is it the pay

15:34.370 --> 15:35.650
that's holding you back?

15:35.650 --> 15:36.860
If you think it's too low,

15:36.860 --> 15:37.820
I can go back

15:37.820 --> 15:38.860
and talk to our boss.

15:38.860 --> 15:40.100
Everything is negotiable.

15:40.100 --> 15:41.170
No, it's not like that.

15:41.170 --> 15:42.700
It's not about the salary.

15:43.650 --> 15:44.860
I'm personally

15:44.940 --> 15:46.940
very into this research direction.

15:46.980 --> 15:48.580
I have no reason to give it up.

15:48.740 --> 15:50.700
Then do you have any other needs?

15:51.130 --> 15:52.170
We will surely satisfy you

15:52.170 --> 15:54.300
as long as it's within our capability.

15:55.890 --> 15:57.620
I haven't thought about it yet.

15:58.050 --> 15:59.010
I'm sorry.

16:00.490 --> 16:01.150
Okay, fine.

16:01.290 --> 16:02.150
How about this?

16:02.250 --> 16:03.820
This is my business card.

16:03.850 --> 16:05.620
You can also take the contract back
and have a look.

16:05.620 --> 16:07.240
If you have any needs,

16:07.390 --> 16:09.050
feel free to contact me, okay?

16:21.330 --> 16:22.120
The rod tip

16:23.370 --> 16:25.820
and the grip
have both been modified, right?

16:25.820 --> 16:26.250
Yep.

16:27.270 --> 16:29.630
The rod tip was replaced
with T1100G carbon cloth.

16:29.630 --> 16:31.220
It's 30% lighter.

16:31.460 --> 16:32.390
As for the handle,

16:32.390 --> 16:33.530
it was replaced with a baitcasting reel.

16:33.530 --> 16:35.840
You'll have better balance when casting.

16:35.840 --> 16:36.970
Nice modification.

16:38.390 --> 16:40.290
Not bad, young man.

16:41.010 --> 16:42.770
You're not only
good at dealing with stereos

16:42.770 --> 16:44.700
but also an expert in fishing rods.

16:46.530 --> 16:47.390
This is for you.

16:53.100 --> 16:53.900
Wait a minute.

16:55.460 --> 16:57.790
Are there any strings attached this time?

16:59.670 --> 17:00.500
Nope,

17:00.550 --> 17:03.130
I just simply want to thank you

17:03.240 --> 17:06.500
for going to listen
to Lin Zhixia's project presentation.

17:07.460 --> 17:08.740
No wonder.

17:09.829 --> 17:10.660
Alright.

17:11.740 --> 17:12.599
How about this?

17:13.220 --> 17:14.880
I have a few more rods in my car.

17:16.810 --> 17:18.069
Modify them all for me.

17:25.010 --> 17:26.290
Oh, Liu.

17:27.810 --> 17:29.540
Fine, I'll modify them for you.

17:30.610 --> 17:32.220
But I recently took some urgent orders.

17:32.220 --> 17:33.330
It'll take a while before I get it done.

17:33.330 --> 17:33.980
No,

17:34.570 --> 17:36.420
I'm going sea fishing next week.

17:36.700 --> 17:37.660
I can't wait.

17:39.420 --> 17:42.250
All right, then I'll work overtime

17:42.610 --> 17:44.070
and let you jump the queue.

17:45.810 --> 17:47.940
Great, really nice.

17:52.010 --> 17:52.770
Everyone,

17:53.400 --> 17:55.110
I'm sure you're well aware

17:55.110 --> 17:56.960
of what we're going to discuss here today.

17:56.960 --> 17:58.690
So I won't beat around the bush.

17:58.770 --> 17:59.570
Up here is

18:00.050 --> 18:02.050
a detailed price evaluation report

18:02.530 --> 18:03.980
that I made.

18:05.090 --> 18:07.090
Whether we should hire Zhou Heng

18:07.530 --> 18:08.850
or an ambassador—

18:09.420 --> 18:11.420
I think it's pretty obvious which one

18:11.420 --> 18:13.270
is more cost-effective

18:13.270 --> 18:14.770
and will bring our company

18:15.460 --> 18:16.660
long-term benefits.

18:23.330 --> 18:23.980
Hou Wei,

18:24.380 --> 18:26.180
do you have anything else to add?

18:27.810 --> 18:29.010
I have nothing to say.

18:29.090 --> 18:29.980
Let's vote.

18:30.980 --> 18:33.780
Raise your hands
if you agree to bring in Zhou Heng.

18:51.290 --> 18:52.810
Duan, just sign it.

18:58.420 --> 18:59.940
So all of you are only willing

18:59.940 --> 19:01.770
to do these superficial vanity projects,

19:01.770 --> 19:02.460
right?

19:02.700 --> 19:03.740
Calm down first.

19:03.980 --> 19:04.610
Duan,

19:04.980 --> 19:06.460
for a small company like ours,

19:06.460 --> 19:08.250
we need to build our hype first.

19:08.980 --> 19:10.140
Getting acquired is

19:10.330 --> 19:12.060
already the best way out for us.

19:14.900 --> 19:16.290
So your goal is

19:16.420 --> 19:17.550
to quickly stir up some hype,

19:17.550 --> 19:18.940
cash out, and run?

19:18.940 --> 19:22.000
Do you really want to build it
into a century-old brand?

19:27.380 --> 19:29.180
Fine, if you want to find a buyer,

19:29.420 --> 19:31.610
feel free to go talk to them.
Just go right away.

19:31.610 --> 19:32.680
I'll sign it for you

19:32.680 --> 19:34.410
whenever you get the deal done.

19:35.010 --> 19:38.410
Selling the company as soon as possible
is good for everyone.

19:39.770 --> 19:43.530
[Fun Biking]

19:56.530 --> 19:58.610
You've already been here for several days
before telling me.

19:58.610 --> 19:59.610
You're so biased.

20:01.290 --> 20:02.740
We're not biased.

20:02.850 --> 20:04.660
If we told you, you'd worry about us.

20:04.660 --> 20:06.660
We didn't want to delay your work.

20:13.290 --> 20:15.150
Dad, what's wrong with your back?

20:15.890 --> 20:17.550
It's nothing. An old problem.

20:20.020 --> 20:21.420
Lumbar disc herniation.

20:21.810 --> 20:22.770
He already had this old injury,

20:22.770 --> 20:24.700
and he strained it again this time.

20:25.010 --> 20:26.740
He kept refusing to go to the hospital.

20:26.740 --> 20:28.740
Whenever it flared up,
he'd just put on a plaster himself.

20:28.740 --> 20:30.460
If Zeqiu and I
hadn't persuaded him this time,

20:30.460 --> 20:32.660
he wouldn't have gone to see the doctor.

20:32.850 --> 20:34.250
So did you go see a doctor?

20:34.900 --> 20:36.460
Yes, I did. I'm fine.

20:38.140 --> 20:39.470
What did the doctor say?

20:40.700 --> 20:42.070
It's nothing serious for now.

20:42.070 --> 20:44.000
It can be treated conservatively.

20:44.420 --> 20:45.750
But the doctor said that

20:45.770 --> 20:47.240
he couldn't do heavy work anymore.

20:47.240 --> 20:49.090
If he gets hurt doing heavy work again,
he'll need surgery.

20:49.090 --> 20:50.090
Did you hear that?

20:50.420 --> 20:52.090
He just won't listen to me.
Talk sense into him.

20:52.090 --> 20:54.900
Dad! How many times have I told you?

20:54.900 --> 20:56.810
Just stop running that supermarket.

20:56.810 --> 20:58.090
It doesn't turn a profit anyway.

20:58.090 --> 20:58.920
If it exhausts you and Mom

20:58.920 --> 21:00.220
and ruins your health,

21:00.220 --> 21:01.550
what will Zeqiu and I do?

21:02.330 --> 21:03.050
See?

21:03.420 --> 21:05.140
You didn't listen to me before.

21:05.140 --> 21:06.570
Now, my sister is saying it, too.

21:06.570 --> 21:07.430
What do you say?

21:07.570 --> 21:08.900
Would you think it over?

21:10.250 --> 21:11.420
Your mom and I are

21:11.440 --> 21:12.900
just sitting around anyway.

21:12.900 --> 21:14.770
Running this small supermarket

21:14.850 --> 21:16.140
allows us to do something.

21:16.140 --> 21:16.770
Besides,

21:16.770 --> 21:18.500
you'll have a lot of expenses
ahead of you.

21:18.500 --> 21:19.500
Mom, Dad,

21:20.460 --> 21:22.140
I'm making money now.

21:22.700 --> 21:24.850
Our family's finances will

21:24.850 --> 21:26.710
surely take a turn for the better.

21:27.500 --> 21:28.380
Why don't you and Mom

21:28.380 --> 21:30.780
just stay at home
and enjoy a peaceful life?

21:31.330 --> 21:32.610
You want me to just idle around
before death?

21:32.610 --> 21:33.610
I didn't say that.

21:37.420 --> 21:39.740
The doctor said it was nothing serious.

21:40.500 --> 21:41.960
Your mom and I just thought

21:42.180 --> 21:44.090
we'd drop by and visit you two.

21:45.010 --> 21:46.410
Now that we have seen you,

21:46.420 --> 21:48.330
we'll head back in a couple of days.

21:48.330 --> 21:49.050
No way.

21:50.330 --> 21:52.330
You have to stay and get treated properly.

21:52.330 --> 21:54.420
Only when the doctor says
you're completely fine

21:54.420 --> 21:55.220
can you leave.

22:05.460 --> 22:06.070
Fine.

22:12.660 --> 22:13.740
Stop laughing.

22:15.140 --> 22:16.740
Everything has its nemesis.

22:17.250 --> 22:19.310
I'll settle the score with you later.

22:21.980 --> 22:24.180
Don't change the channel.
Let's watch this.

22:24.180 --> 22:25.610
Get up a bit. I'll put...

22:25.900 --> 22:26.660
Put a cushion behind you.

22:26.660 --> 22:27.390
Take it slow.

22:28.250 --> 22:29.700
Yes, yes, slowly.

22:30.220 --> 22:32.020
Is it more comfortable this way?

22:32.420 --> 22:33.460
From now on, you have to tell me

22:33.460 --> 22:35.050
anything happening at home immediately.

22:35.050 --> 22:36.250
Don't hide it from me.

22:38.090 --> 22:39.460
I didn't hide anything from you.

22:39.460 --> 22:40.990
Mom asked me not to tell you,

22:41.330 --> 22:42.730
afraid you'd be worried.

22:43.050 --> 22:45.380
You didn't tell me
just because Mom told you not to?

22:45.380 --> 22:46.250
You traitor.

22:47.700 --> 22:49.760
Then next time, I'll tell you at once.

22:54.330 --> 22:55.990
What else haven't you told me?

22:58.460 --> 22:59.090
Nothing.

23:04.140 --> 23:05.070
Really nothing.

23:06.290 --> 23:08.290
Those things on your desk are

23:09.140 --> 23:10.980
not all yours, are they?

23:13.180 --> 23:14.180
They are all mine.

23:14.290 --> 23:15.090
All of them.

23:15.660 --> 23:18.120
Not a single thing
belongs to someone else?

23:18.180 --> 23:19.700
No, I bought them all.

23:21.530 --> 23:22.810
Forget it if you don't want to tell me.

23:22.810 --> 23:24.870
I'll find out sooner or later anyway.

23:25.570 --> 23:28.100
I really don't get
what you're talking about.

23:29.500 --> 23:30.610
You're hiding something.

23:30.610 --> 23:31.610
No.

23:32.530 --> 23:33.420
I'm not.

23:57.500 --> 23:58.300
What's wrong?

23:58.660 --> 24:00.390
Why are you pulling a long face?

24:07.530 --> 24:09.660
My dad came to see the doctor this time,

24:12.140 --> 24:12.940
and I realized

24:13.090 --> 24:14.900
how much he had aged.

24:18.290 --> 24:20.310
If he does any more heavy work,

24:20.310 --> 24:22.110
he'll need surgery for his back.

24:22.900 --> 24:24.090
When it hurts now,

24:24.250 --> 24:25.530
even medicated plasters don't work.

24:25.530 --> 24:26.730
He just has to bear it.

24:28.140 --> 24:29.400
Do you need money then?

24:30.420 --> 24:31.740
My average transaction value
has gone up lately...

24:31.740 --> 24:32.540
Don't bother.

24:32.810 --> 24:34.610
You don't need to worry about it.

24:38.980 --> 24:41.310
I just want to take
some pressure off them.

24:43.180 --> 24:46.840
I don't want Zeqiu to carry the burden
of the family all by himself.

24:47.290 --> 24:49.490
He'll have his own family in the future.

24:51.050 --> 24:52.500
If I go out to work,

24:52.900 --> 24:54.290
my mom, dad, and brother will

24:54.290 --> 24:56.020
have it a little easier, right?

24:58.810 --> 24:59.740
I think

25:00.770 --> 25:01.830
you've got a point.

25:03.180 --> 25:04.010
However,

25:04.500 --> 25:06.100
you should also ask yourself

25:07.090 --> 25:09.220
what you really want deep down inside.

25:11.570 --> 25:13.570
I want to stay in school, of course.

25:13.940 --> 25:16.900
There are still many projects
I haven't figured out yet.

25:16.900 --> 25:18.630
If I go to a commercial company,

25:19.140 --> 25:21.340
I'll be doing other people's projects.

25:23.770 --> 25:24.380
I also think

25:24.380 --> 25:27.440
doing scientific research in school
suits you better.

25:29.380 --> 25:30.380
Have you asked for

25:30.420 --> 25:31.820
your brother's opinion?

25:33.500 --> 25:34.610
He won't agree.

25:35.420 --> 25:36.680
I know he cherishes me.

25:38.830 --> 25:40.250
When he was still a college student,

25:40.250 --> 25:42.910
he already did part-time jobs
in his spare time,

25:43.380 --> 25:46.010
just in order to shoulder
the family's burden earlier.

25:46.010 --> 25:47.940
But I'm also a member of the family.

25:53.010 --> 25:54.610
I know what you're thinking.

25:55.140 --> 25:55.980
But

25:56.330 --> 25:57.860
don't jump to conclusions.

25:58.250 --> 25:59.650
Take time to think it over

26:00.180 --> 26:01.980
and discuss it with your family.

26:02.420 --> 26:04.020
Whatever decision you make,

26:04.980 --> 26:06.580
I'll be with you by your side.

26:30.290 --> 26:30.940
Ms. Ling,

26:31.570 --> 26:33.460
I'd like to talk with you again about

26:33.460 --> 26:35.120
what you brought up last time.

26:35.570 --> 26:36.590
Great, Lin.

26:36.900 --> 26:38.010
You've changed your mind?

26:38.010 --> 26:39.810
I'll make time for it right away.

26:41.480 --> 26:44.280
Touch up quickly
and get ready for the next outfit.

26:45.220 --> 26:46.680
Alright, look right here.

26:47.940 --> 26:49.800
Good, you can smile a little more.

26:49.940 --> 26:51.940
Great. You're looking really good.

26:52.290 --> 26:54.220
One more. Let me try another angle.

26:54.480 --> 26:55.980
These are clothes for Su Mo later.

26:55.980 --> 26:56.900
Ask the director which one works best

26:56.900 --> 26:57.740
and have him change into it.

26:57.740 --> 26:58.740
Got it, Tingting.

27:03.980 --> 27:05.140
Tingting, check it out.

27:05.140 --> 27:06.740
What do you think of his look?

27:06.980 --> 27:08.080
If everything's good,

27:08.080 --> 27:09.540
we'll move to the next set.

27:09.850 --> 27:10.570
Let me see.

27:12.940 --> 27:14.180
Okay, very good.

27:20.740 --> 27:23.900
Jiang, I've just realized—

27:25.050 --> 27:28.770
t-these so-called friends I grew up with

27:29.550 --> 27:32.720
are all so fake and hypocritical!

27:34.660 --> 27:35.520
That's enough.

27:35.660 --> 27:36.660
You should drink less.

27:36.660 --> 27:37.920
Oh, right, there's...

27:39.050 --> 27:41.290
one more thing about Tang Tingting.

27:44.350 --> 27:46.080
I really don't understand her.

27:46.770 --> 27:47.700
What did I do

27:48.660 --> 27:50.850
to mess with her all day?

27:52.740 --> 27:54.050
I feel like in her eyes,

27:54.460 --> 27:59.290
I can't do anything right.

28:06.380 --> 28:09.660
I can't do anything right.

28:10.140 --> 28:12.050
I just feel like I'm nobody.

28:12.050 --> 28:13.500
I'm a total loser!

28:18.220 --> 28:19.950
I think this looks pretty good.

28:20.050 --> 28:21.050
Let's call it a day.

28:21.050 --> 28:21.900
Okay, sure.

28:22.220 --> 28:22.850
Alright,

28:23.660 --> 28:24.420
it's a wrap.

28:24.660 --> 28:25.860
Great job, everyone.

28:26.700 --> 28:27.770
Not bad.

28:28.180 --> 28:29.010
Thank you, Yu.

28:29.220 --> 28:29.810
Keep it up.

28:29.810 --> 28:31.420
Great job, everyone! Thank you all!

28:31.420 --> 28:32.460
Well done.

28:33.570 --> 28:34.290
Tingting.

28:35.770 --> 28:37.500
Did I do a really good job today?

28:37.850 --> 28:39.250
You did great. Keep it up.

28:39.290 --> 28:40.220
Good work today.

28:40.740 --> 28:42.140
You've been busy all day.

28:42.140 --> 28:44.400
Come and grab a bite with everyone later.

28:44.530 --> 28:45.330
My treat.

28:45.570 --> 28:46.900
I'm not going.
I have something urgent to handle.

28:46.900 --> 28:48.500
You guys go ahead. It's on me.

28:48.660 --> 28:49.380
What is it?

28:49.380 --> 28:51.180
Do you have to handle it tonight?

28:51.900 --> 28:52.980
It's about that unlucky friend of mine.

28:52.980 --> 28:54.290
I don't know what's wrong with him again.

28:54.290 --> 28:55.180
He's probably drunk too much.

28:55.180 --> 28:56.510
I have to go check on him.

28:56.660 --> 28:57.500
You go ahead.

28:58.010 --> 28:59.180
Good job, guys!

29:01.770 --> 29:04.010
Tingting, be careful then!

29:04.500 --> 29:05.140
Okay.

29:06.250 --> 29:07.770
I came up with the idea

29:07.770 --> 29:10.050
and built the company myself from scratch.

29:10.050 --> 29:11.460
Now they're kicking me out!

29:11.460 --> 29:13.740
Is there no justice anymore? Is there...

29:13.740 --> 29:14.460
Who's it?

29:16.180 --> 29:17.380
What brings you here?

29:18.610 --> 29:20.470
What's this show today, Mr. Duan?

29:21.420 --> 29:23.550
No show. It's nothing.

29:24.570 --> 29:25.700
Stubborn as always.

29:26.220 --> 29:28.350
Did you run into trouble at work again?

29:32.250 --> 29:35.570
The company... That's just a small issue.

29:37.140 --> 29:38.050
A small issue?

29:38.250 --> 29:39.700
You got this drunk over a small issue?

29:39.700 --> 29:41.230
Can this solve the problem?

29:44.010 --> 29:44.810
Nope.

29:44.980 --> 29:46.310
Then what should you do?

29:47.820 --> 29:49.340
What should I do, Jiang?

29:50.010 --> 29:51.460
I don't know either.

29:51.460 --> 29:53.120
I'm asking what you should do.

29:56.810 --> 29:57.610
I should...

29:58.290 --> 30:00.220
I should go communicate with them!

30:01.180 --> 30:03.050
Do you know how?
Do you need me to teach you?

30:03.050 --> 30:04.900
No need! I know how!

30:06.700 --> 30:07.740
Are you still drinking then?

30:07.740 --> 30:09.460
No. You drink,

30:09.980 --> 30:10.570
Jiang.

30:10.810 --> 30:11.570
I'll drink.

30:12.420 --> 30:13.950
Alright, I'm leaving then.

30:19.050 --> 30:19.710
I'm hungry.

30:27.180 --> 30:28.250
Oh, man...

30:28.500 --> 30:30.960
Let's go, Jiang.
Let's grab a bite together.

30:31.290 --> 30:32.570
I will skip this one.

30:32.610 --> 30:33.670
You guys go and eat.

30:34.900 --> 30:36.870
Come and grab a bite, Jiang.

30:38.090 --> 30:38.700
Come on.

30:54.770 --> 30:55.810
Why are you looking at me?

30:55.810 --> 30:57.540
Aren't you hungry? Just eat up.

30:58.900 --> 30:59.610
Tingting,

31:00.220 --> 31:02.350
you're the only one who treats me well.

31:02.700 --> 31:05.140
You've ignored me for such a long time.

31:05.420 --> 31:07.620
I thought I'd never get to see you again.

31:08.500 --> 31:10.500
If you act this foolish again
after drinking,

31:10.500 --> 31:12.160
you really won't see me again.

31:13.380 --> 31:14.010
Tingting,

31:14.810 --> 31:16.050
although I don't know

31:16.050 --> 31:18.770
why you've been sulking lately,

31:19.250 --> 31:20.560
I do know one thing.

31:20.710 --> 31:22.610
It must be because I offended you somehow

31:22.610 --> 31:23.810
and made you unhappy.

31:26.770 --> 31:29.090
I apologize to you, Tingting.

31:29.940 --> 31:31.140
Can you let it go?

31:32.610 --> 31:34.010
Didn't you claim that you'd find

31:34.010 --> 31:36.290
an inverse function
that's completely different from me?

31:36.290 --> 31:38.570
That noodle shop lady is
gentle and considerate.

31:38.570 --> 31:39.570
Isn't she your ideal type?

31:39.570 --> 31:41.380
Why do you want to come to me?
Just go find her.

31:41.380 --> 31:42.440
It's not like that.

31:43.330 --> 31:45.460
I've only dined there a couple of times

31:45.530 --> 31:48.330
and chatted casually.
When did I ever look for her?

31:48.610 --> 31:49.700
Keep chatting then.

31:49.700 --> 31:51.760
I think you two are quite a good match.

31:52.270 --> 31:54.140
It's really not what you think.

31:54.250 --> 31:55.330
I'm not familiar with her at all.

31:55.330 --> 31:56.140
I have meals there

31:56.140 --> 31:57.220
simply because her place

31:57.220 --> 31:58.380
is close to my company.

31:58.380 --> 31:59.290
That's all.

31:59.660 --> 32:00.880
We've never talked

32:00.880 --> 32:01.940
about anything else.

32:01.940 --> 32:03.380
Every time I finish eating,

32:03.380 --> 32:04.590
I'm only being polite and saying goodbye

32:04.590 --> 32:05.200
when leaving.

32:05.200 --> 32:06.090
That's all.

32:06.090 --> 32:07.330
I don't even have her WeChat.

32:07.330 --> 32:08.500
How is that even knowing her?

32:08.500 --> 32:09.630
You've got me wrong.

32:10.220 --> 32:11.950
Why are you explaining it to me?

32:12.010 --> 32:13.410
It's none of my business.

32:19.610 --> 32:21.140
Of course I have to explain.

32:24.460 --> 32:26.050
I can't let you stay mad.

33:01.980 --> 33:02.770
I'm full.

33:28.420 --> 33:29.530
Mom, Dad, Zeqiu,

33:29.850 --> 33:32.000
you don't have to worry
about money anymore.

33:32.000 --> 33:32.850
I found a job

33:33.200 --> 33:34.000
with good pay.

33:35.050 --> 33:35.850
The signing bonus is high,

33:35.850 --> 33:37.380
and the annual salary is good.

33:37.380 --> 33:40.380
They want me to join
as soon as I get my doctoral degree.

33:42.740 --> 33:45.400
You went to find a job
instead of going to school?

33:46.380 --> 33:48.180
By then, you can close the supermarket.

33:48.180 --> 33:49.180
I'll support you.

33:49.400 --> 33:51.290
And Zeqiu won't have to work late
for overtime pay

33:51.290 --> 33:52.620
and project subsidies.

33:55.420 --> 33:56.830
We can buy a big house,

33:57.090 --> 33:59.550
so the whole family
can live together again.

34:01.140 --> 34:02.900
I'm not dead from overtime work yet.

34:02.900 --> 34:04.140
Don't worry about family matters.

34:04.140 --> 34:05.670
Just take care of yourself.

34:08.010 --> 34:09.570
I'm a part of this family, too.

34:09.570 --> 34:11.170
It's my responsibility, too.

34:11.170 --> 34:12.150
I'm grown up now.

34:12.340 --> 34:13.780
Stop treating me like a child.

34:13.780 --> 34:15.780
Alright, stop it for now.

34:16.730 --> 34:18.130
What exactly is going on?

34:18.260 --> 34:18.940
Yeah.

34:20.730 --> 34:22.980
Lin Zhixia feels that you are
too overworked,

34:22.980 --> 34:25.070
and we haven't
fulfilled our duties as children,

34:25.070 --> 34:26.000
especially her.

34:26.500 --> 34:27.760
So she wants to leave school

34:27.760 --> 34:29.560
and start working to make money.

34:39.210 --> 34:39.870
Then can she

34:40.260 --> 34:42.460
still work on the research she loves?

34:44.170 --> 34:45.210
Yes, of course.

34:46.900 --> 34:47.760
You keep quiet.

34:48.650 --> 34:49.580
Let Zeqiu speak.

34:51.090 --> 34:52.489
How could it be that easy?

34:52.610 --> 34:54.469
If she goes there and they pay her,

34:54.530 --> 34:55.860
she has to do their work.

34:56.440 --> 34:57.010
Although it won't be like

34:57.010 --> 34:59.070
she has to do whatever they ask her to,

34:59.840 --> 35:01.220
her research will definitely be affected.

35:01.220 --> 35:02.570
How can that be?

35:03.530 --> 35:05.170
Wait, Zhixia,

35:05.900 --> 35:08.030
do you have any idea what you are doing?

35:10.420 --> 35:12.880
Your mom and I haven't seen
much of the world.

35:13.190 --> 35:13.630
But I

35:13.820 --> 35:14.510
do know

35:14.510 --> 35:15.800
our children well.

35:16.900 --> 35:18.540
That's right, Zhixia.

35:19.190 --> 35:21.320
Didn't Professor Shen also say before

35:22.230 --> 35:23.260
that turning your passion into a career

35:23.260 --> 35:24.460
is a kind of blessing?

35:24.920 --> 35:27.380
You've been different from other kids
since you were little.

35:27.380 --> 35:29.510
And now you're doing what you love.

35:30.420 --> 35:32.570
How could you just

35:32.820 --> 35:33.940
give up your dream

35:34.730 --> 35:36.260
for short-term gain?

35:41.980 --> 35:42.460
Hey,

35:43.340 --> 35:45.800
it's not like our family
can't get by anymore

35:46.420 --> 35:48.080
and needs you to go make money.

35:48.850 --> 35:50.550
Yes, most people

35:50.820 --> 35:52.730
in this society are busy working

35:52.730 --> 35:54.630
to make money every day.

35:54.630 --> 35:55.130
But

35:55.710 --> 35:57.600
you can realize your dream

35:57.800 --> 35:59.200
and have a decent income.

36:00.300 --> 36:02.150
You... Girl,

36:02.150 --> 36:03.320
what on earth is

36:03.690 --> 36:05.300
going on in your head?

36:08.010 --> 36:09.090
What Dad means is that

36:09.090 --> 36:10.650
you only need
to take good care of yourself.

36:10.650 --> 36:12.310
Don't worry about the family.

36:12.690 --> 36:13.210
But...

36:13.210 --> 36:13.940
No buts!

36:19.100 --> 36:21.260
Are your mom and I a burden to you now?

36:21.860 --> 36:23.550
Are we so long in the tooth
that we need you to support us?

36:23.550 --> 36:25.190
I didn't mean that.

36:25.920 --> 36:27.460
I just want everyone
to live a better life.

36:27.460 --> 36:28.920
Why are you all blaming me?

36:29.130 --> 36:31.490
Do you think we'll live a happy life

36:32.010 --> 36:33.340
if you make a sacrifice?

36:34.210 --> 36:34.900
Zhixia,

36:35.280 --> 36:36.190
do you know that

36:36.940 --> 36:38.090
in that case,

36:38.690 --> 36:39.730
your mom and I...

36:41.400 --> 36:43.380
will feel like we're a burden
to our children?

36:43.380 --> 36:44.910
What are you talking about?

36:45.570 --> 36:46.860
Our daughter didn't mean that.

36:46.860 --> 36:49.260
Look how much you've infuriated yourself.

36:50.300 --> 36:51.050
Zhixia,

36:52.210 --> 36:53.780
Mom and Dad mean

36:54.940 --> 36:56.130
that we hope

36:57.300 --> 36:58.980
you can do what you want to do,

37:00.130 --> 37:02.210
see the scenery you want to see,

37:03.170 --> 37:05.030
and live the life you want to live.

37:05.380 --> 37:07.170
This is our biggest wish.

37:08.610 --> 37:10.140
Only then will your dad and I

37:10.650 --> 37:12.340
be truly happy

37:12.940 --> 37:13.980
and satisfied.

37:14.530 --> 37:15.300
Do you get it?

37:31.000 --> 37:31.560
Alright,

37:31.690 --> 37:32.490
let's drop it.

37:35.170 --> 37:35.900
You

37:36.860 --> 37:38.570
should really think it over.

37:44.010 --> 37:45.150
There's no rush for this anyway.

37:45.150 --> 37:46.150
Just think twice.

37:47.460 --> 37:49.410
Give it some more thought.

37:52.050 --> 37:53.580
Think it through properly.

38:24.730 --> 38:25.530
What's wrong?

38:27.820 --> 38:28.620
I got scolded.

38:38.900 --> 38:39.830
Who scolded you?

38:41.050 --> 38:42.310
Firstly, it was Zeqiu,

38:43.500 --> 38:45.980
and then the three of them
took turns scolding me.

38:45.980 --> 38:48.510
In the end,
everyone was too angry to even eat.

38:48.650 --> 38:50.980
You told them
about your plan to go to work?

38:51.900 --> 38:53.360
Of course they'd be angry.

39:00.820 --> 39:02.530
You knew they would be angry?

39:05.260 --> 39:06.860
So you also disagree, right?

39:09.650 --> 39:10.580
So, Jiang Yubai,

39:11.380 --> 39:13.500
you don't approve of me
going to work at all.

39:13.500 --> 39:14.560
And you still said,

39:14.940 --> 39:17.050
"Whatever you decide to do,
I'll support you." Why?

39:17.050 --> 39:18.110
It's not like that.

39:18.650 --> 39:19.980
I really think

39:20.210 --> 39:21.780
you've got a point, too.

39:22.040 --> 39:23.700
You're not telling the truth.

39:25.050 --> 39:26.250
I'm really not lying.

39:26.780 --> 39:29.170
I just feel that as smart as you are,

39:29.190 --> 39:30.500
you must have

39:30.500 --> 39:32.160
thought everything through.

39:35.570 --> 39:36.980
Why do you always throw

39:36.980 --> 39:39.240
your principles away when it's about me?

39:40.950 --> 39:42.930
My principle is to make you happy.

39:51.210 --> 39:52.460
Do you really like me?

39:53.940 --> 39:55.570
Of course, I really like you.

39:56.780 --> 39:57.800
If you like someone,

39:57.800 --> 40:00.000
you'll help her become a better person.

40:00.090 --> 40:01.530
You knew I was wrong,

40:01.530 --> 40:02.790
but you didn't tell me.

40:04.130 --> 40:05.340
I make mistakes, too.

40:05.650 --> 40:07.860
There are also many things
I don't understand.

40:07.860 --> 40:09.720
Are you planning to never tell me?

40:16.900 --> 40:17.780
Lin Zhixia,

40:18.340 --> 40:19.170
you're right.

40:20.300 --> 40:21.300
All these years,

40:21.860 --> 40:24.390
I seem to have
gotten used to looking up to you.

40:24.650 --> 40:26.090
So I'd often go along

40:26.420 --> 40:29.020
with whatever you said
without even thinking.

40:29.530 --> 40:30.330
It's my fault.

40:30.690 --> 40:31.650
From now on,

40:31.940 --> 40:32.900
if my opinions are

40:32.900 --> 40:34.260
at odds with yours,

40:34.940 --> 40:37.000
I will be completely honest with you.

40:41.900 --> 40:42.960
No more looking up.

40:43.090 --> 40:45.550
You're already
looking down at me right now.

40:51.500 --> 40:52.340
How about now?

41:01.460 --> 41:02.590
It's all your fault.

41:02.870 --> 41:04.090
If you had told me earlier,

41:04.090 --> 41:05.680
I wouldn't have been scolded.

41:05.680 --> 41:06.510
Yeah,

41:07.090 --> 41:09.290
but I deserved to be scolded by you, too.

41:09.670 --> 41:10.470
You know what?

41:11.170 --> 41:13.830
You were quite fierce
when scolding me just now.

41:25.760 --> 41:27.360
No matter how long it's been,

41:27.880 --> 41:29.510
I will never forget that day

41:30.570 --> 41:33.030
and how I felt
when I ran towards Jiang Yubai.

41:34.050 --> 41:35.110
I finally realized

41:35.760 --> 41:37.920
that the overwhelming bittersweet ache

41:37.920 --> 41:39.180
wasn't about illness,

41:40.260 --> 41:41.120
but about love,

41:42.480 --> 41:43.280
heartache,

41:44.300 --> 41:45.210
pity,

41:46.460 --> 41:47.790
and reluctance to part.

41:48.590 --> 41:49.720
At that very moment,

41:50.500 --> 41:52.100
it felt like a crack opened up

41:52.820 --> 41:55.050
in my inner universe,

41:56.440 --> 41:59.440
revealing a new world
that I had never reached before.

42:00.190 --> 42:01.790
It turned out that all along,

42:02.880 --> 42:04.810
I had been in love with Jiang Yubai.

